<title>FRANCE: BNP shares busy in block trades.</title>
<headline>BNP shares busy in block trades.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two big blocks of Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP) shares changed hands around midday on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>One block of 880,000 shares traded at 225.70 francs at 1007 GMT, with another block of 941,000 shares trading at 226 francs at 1010 GMT.</p>
<p>One broker said BNP shares go ex-dividend on Wednesday and the trades may have been related to tax considerations.</p>
<p>At 1034 GMT, BNP shares were up 0.98 percent at 227.20 francs.</p>
</text>
